@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Book Room

start

:Student selects room, start time and end time;
:Submit booking request;

if (Start time is in the future?) then ([yes])
else ([no])
  :Reject request: start time must be in the future;
  stop
endif

if (Duration greater than 0 and at most 2 hours?) then ([yes])
else ([no])
  :Reject request: duration must be greater than 0 and at most 2 hours;
  stop
endif

if (Room is blocked?) then ([yes])
  :Reject request: room is out of service;
  stop
else ([no])
endif

floating note right
  R2: only ACTIVE bookings count,
  CANCELLED ones are ignored.
  A1: touching bookings do not overlap.
end note
if (Slot overlaps an active booking for this room?) then ([yes])
  :Reject request: slot already booked;
  stop
else ([no])
endif

:Create booking with status ACTIVE;
:Generate confirmation;
:Show confirmation to Student;

stop
@enduml
